<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-3761] Aliasing is not working with JDBC interperter</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-3761</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Using aliasing to rename the column name is not really working. For instance a SELECT like this renames &quot;aircraft&quot; column in output to &quot;something&quot; in MySQL terminal, but not in Zeppelin:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;SELECT aircraft AS something FROM birdstrikes LIMIT 5;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment>&lt;p&gt;MySQL 5.7.23&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Zeppelin 0.8.0&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Driver:&#160;mysql:mysql-connector-java:5.1.41&lt;/p&gt;</environment>
