                            <comment id="16603966" author="mebelousov" created="Wed, 5 Sep 2018 06:15:32 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I can confirm this bug.&lt;br/&gt;
It seems something wrong in MySQL JDBC driver.&lt;br/&gt;
The column names are extracted in line &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;1&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
 msg.append(replaceReservedChars(md.getColumnName(i)));
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Need more detailed investigations. &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Tested on MySQL version 5.5.41-cll-lve and JDBC driver is mysql-connector-java-8.0.11.jar&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;1. &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/blob/0318a94b8b85a2efb863e845f10dc9a1117aa7eb/jdbc/src/main/java/org/apache/zeppelin/jdbc/JDBCInterpreter.java#L543&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/blob/0318a94b8b85a2efb863e845f10dc9a1117aa7eb/jdbc/src/main/java/org/apache/zeppelin/jdbc/JDBCInterpreter.java#L543&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</comment>
